<title>USA: Beacon Properties files debt, stock shelf.</title>
<headline>Beacon Properties files debt, stock shelf.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Beacon Properties Corp Thursday filed a shelf registration with the Securities and Exchange Commission to offer $288 million in debt securities and preferred and common stock.</p>
<p>The company said the shelf filing included $712 million carried over from a previous registration for a total of $1 billion.</p>
<p>Net proceeds will be used for general corporate purposes, including repaying debt, the real estate investment trust said.</p>
